    "innovation": "This paper demonstrates that human activities are a dominant constraint on the distribution of *Rhodiola kirilowii* on the Tibetan Plateau by comparing MaxEnt models with and without anthropogenic factors, revealing that human influence significantly reduces suitable habitat and impedes future climate-driven migration.",
